      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand that you're seeking relief, but taking any supplement without consulting your healthcare provider can inadvertently worsen your kidney function, especially in the context of stage 3 CKD. It is incredibly important to have your doctor or a registered dietitian review your current health status and recommendations for managing your symptoms safely before making any changes. They'll work on getting you an appointment sooner, so in the meantime, you can discuss prescribing something for your cramps.",
